    "sections": {
        "description": "ST Logistics is a clean, lightweight, and fully responsive WordPress theme built for logistics companies, transportation services, cargo and freight forwarding agencies, delivery and courier services, moving companies, shipment and shipping companies, transport companies, freight transport, logistic warehouse, trucking, warehouse businesses, and supply chain providers. The theme is coded to modern standards and optimized for speed, so pages load quickly and read comfortably on desktops, tablets, and mobile devices. Flexible customizer options, ready-made sections, and full blog support make it simple to present your fleet, services, delivery coverage, and company story without touching a line of code. ST Logistics works with popular page builders and supports WooCommerce, which makes it suitable for online shipment booking, transport quotes, and logistics management solutions. It is translation ready, RTL friendly, and follows accessibility and SEO best practices for better search visibility. Whether you run a logistics firm, a cargo or courier service, a haulage fleet, or a supply chain business, ST Logistics gives you a stylish, flexible, and professional foundation for a strong online presence."
    },
